        <mxCell id="e9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#5a5a5a;strokeWidth=1;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="units.unit_id" target="assembly_requests.unit_id">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points">
            <mxPoint x="940" y="505" />
            <mxPoint x="940" y="315" />
          </Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel0" value="&lt;b&gt;표기법&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; 기본키 · &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; 외래키 — 선은 두 필드 행에 직접 붙는다&lt;br&gt;• 선 방향: PK 필드 ──&amp;lt; FK 필드 (1 : N)&lt;br&gt;• NULL 표기가 없는 열은 &lt;b&gt;NOT NULL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;= 값&lt;/b&gt; 은 DEFAULT, &lt;b&gt;identity&lt;/b&gt; 는 자동 증가&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[U1]~[U4]&lt;/b&gt; 복합 UNIQUE · &lt;b&gt;[CHECK] [CK …]&lt;/b&gt; CHECK 제약&lt;br&gt;• 타입은 PostgreSQL 실제 타입 (varchar/enum 아님)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=12;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#cccccc;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="970" width="460" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel1" value="&lt;b&gt;CHECK 허용값 (PostgreSQL 은 enum 대신 text + CHECK 사용)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;jobs.job_status&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;assembly_requests.request_status&lt;/b&gt;* : PENDING/QUEUED · RUNNING · COMPLETED · FAILED · CANCELLED&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;units.unit_status&lt;/b&gt; : RUNNING · COMPLETED · FAILED   |   &lt;b&gt;units.inspection_result&lt;/b&gt; : PENDING · PASS · FAIL&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;unit_defects.defect_type&lt;/b&gt; : MISSING · POSITION_ERROR · ORIENTATION_ERROR · CRACK&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;inventory_movements.movement_type&lt;/b&gt; : OPENING · RECEIPT · CONSUMPTION · ADJUSTMENT&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;assembly_requests.runtime_mode&lt;/b&gt; : mock · real&lt;br&gt;• * request_status 의 첫 값은 QUEUED, job_status 의 첫 값은 PENDING" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=12;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#cccccc;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="970" width="690" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="panel2" value="&lt;b&gt;UNIQUE 와 부분 인덱스 (열 표기만으로는 보이지 않는 제약)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;U1&lt;/b&gt; products (product_code, product_version)     &lt;b&gt;U2&lt;/b&gt; product_slots (product_id, slot_code)     &lt;b&gt;U3&lt;/b&gt; units (job_id, unit_sequence_in_job)     &lt;b&gt;U4&lt;/b&gt; unit_defects (unit_id, product_slot_id)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;uq_jobs_single_active&lt;/b&gt; : job_status ∈ (PENDING, RUNNING) 인 행은 전체에서 최대 1개&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;uq_assembly_requests_single_running&lt;/b&gt; : request_status = 'RUNNING' 인 행은 전체에서 최대 1개 — 위 제약과 같은 규칙을 두 스키마에서 이중으로 건다&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;uq_inventory_movements_opening&lt;/b&gt; : movement_type = 'OPENING' 은 부품당 1행     &lt;b&gt;uq_inventory_movements_unit_part&lt;/b&gt; : CONSUMPTION 은 (unit_id, part_id) 당 1행&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;ix_assembly_requests_queue&lt;/b&gt; (runtime_mode, requested_at) WHERE request_status = 'QUEUED' — Sequencer 의 FIFO claim 경로" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=12;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#cccccc;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="1150" width="1180" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
